@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# Ganti ID berikut dengan ID dari response create masing-masing.
@userId = 1
@postId = 1
@commentId = 1

### Cek server dan koneksi Neon
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Buat user (gunakan email lain bila sudah terdaftar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "name": "Budi",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### Daftar user (tanpa password)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### Detail user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### Ubah nama user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Budi Santoso" }

### Buat post pertama (draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar Express dan Prisma",
  "content": "Materi Modul 4",
  "authorId": {{userId}}
}

### Buat post kedua untuk mencoba pagination
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar relasi Comment",
  "authorId": {{userId}}
}

### Publish post yang dipilih
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "published": true }

### Daftar post dengan pencarian/filter/pagination (materi utama)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?search=express&published=true&page=1&limit=5

### Detail post
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Statistik dasar materi utama (bukan challenge statistik harian)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/stats

### Challenge 1: buat komentar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Penjelasannya membantu!",
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "postId": {{postId}}
}

### Challenge 1: semua komentar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments

### Challenge 1: detail komentar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/{{commentId}}

### Challenge 1: ubah komentar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/{{commentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Komentar yang sudah diperbarui" }

### Challenge 2: semua post user, halaman pertama
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/posts?page=1&limit=1

### Challenge 2: halaman kedua
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/posts?page=2&limit=1

### Challenge 2: hanya published
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/posts?published=true&page=1&limit=5

### Challenge 2: hanya draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/posts?published=false&page=1&limit=5

### Query tidak valid -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/posts?published=yes

### ID tidak valid -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/abc

### Hapus komentar (GET detail setelahnya -> 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/{{commentId}}

### Hapus post (komentar pada post ikut terhapus)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Hapus user (post dan komentar milik user ikut terhapus)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### ===== Challenge 20 nomor 5: eksperimen Neon branch =====
### Jalankan request ini dua kali: sekali saat .env mengarah ke branch eksperimen,
### sekali saat .env mengarah ke main. Restart server setiap kali .env diganti.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "branch-test@example.com",
  "name": "Data Branch",
  "password": "branch12345"
}

### Bandingkan isi users di branch vs main
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### ===== Challenge 20 nomor 6: validasi input =====
### Email dan password salah sekaligus -> 400, kedua error muncul di "errors"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi",
  "password": "123"
}

### Password tanpa angka -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "andi@example.com",
  "password": "rahasiaaa"
}

### Email huruf besar + spasi -> 201, disimpan "citra@example.com"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "  Citra@Example.COM ",
  "name": "Citra",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### PATCH dengan email tidak valid -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bukan-email"
}